---
source: crates/cli/tests/help.rs
expression: "help(&[\"--help\"])"
---
A spreadsheet for Omarchy Linux

Usage: omacell [OPTIONS] [FILE]... [COMMAND]

Commands:
  convert    Convert a workbook between `.xlsx`, CSV, and `.omc`
  query      Print a range as json, csv, or markdown
  set        Set a cell or range from formula-bar text
  eval       Evaluate a formula in a workbook
  recalc     Recalculate a workbook
  run        Run a Lua script (WP-20)
  fn         Function catalog
  config     Configuration
  theme      Theme inspection and reload
  keys       Keymap / Hyprland conflict check
  setup      Omarchy integration
  commands   List registered commands and JSON schemas
  ipc        Talk to a running instance
  changeset  Changesets on a running instance
  diff       Semantic `.xlsx` diff
  audit      Deterministic audit (WP-19)
  ai         AI provider commands (WP-22)
  agent      Hand off to the Omarchy default agent (WP-21)
  mcp        MCP server (WP-21)

Arguments:
  [FILE]...  Workbook paths. With no subcommand, opens the GUI (WP-16)

Options:
      --json                  Machine-readable stdout (and stderr errors)
      --dry-run               Validate writes without changing files
      --set <KEY=VALUE>       Overlay a dotted config key (`appearance.grid_lines=false`). Repeatable
      --config <FILE>         Explicit config file; replaces `~/.config/omacell/config.toml`
      --theme <FILE>          Explicit theme `colors.toml`; wins over `OMACELL_THEME`
  -q, --quiet                 Suppress non-error human output
  -v, --verbose...            Increase log verbosity
      --tui                   Open the terminal UI (WP-15)
      --from-workbook <FILE>  Workbook whose frozen settings overlay configuration
  -h, --help                  Print help
  -V, --version               Print version
